# No trailing slashes on any of these. In a worktree they are symlinks into the
# main checkout rather than real directories, and git sees a symlink as a file:
# `runtime/` matched the directory in ~/rn and missed the symlink in ~/cb, which
# left a machine-specific `be/runtime -> /home/pde/rn/be/runtime` sitting
# untracked, one `git add -A` from being committed. The slash-less form covers
# both.
node_modules
runtime
# Alternative bundled runtimes, resolved by launcher/src/layout.rs
runtime-bun
runtime-deno
runtime-node*
.env

# Profiling artifacts dropped in cwd by --cpu-prof / --heap-prof and V8 logging
*.cpuprofile
*.heapprofile
isolate-*.log
jit-*.dump
